docs {
  # PeopleService.ProposePlacement

  Cycle and grade the cuadro de equivalencias (RVM 0018-2007-ED) proposes for EBR studies

  `/ltedu.people.v1.PeopleService/ProposePlacement` · unary · `ltedu/people/v1/people.proto`

  ## Request — `ProposePlacementRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `origin` | `string` | ebr_primaria \| ebr_secundaria |
  | `passed` | `int32` | Grades passed (0 to 6) |

  ## Response — `ProposePlacementResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `level_id` | `string` |  |
  | `level_name` | `string` |  |
  | `grade_id` | `string` |  |
  | `grade_name` | `string` |  |
  | `done` | `bool` | The studies already complete the EBA |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
}
